TI  - Exploiting Smart City IoT for Disaster Recovery Operations
T2  - 2018 IEEE 4TH WORLD FORUM ON INTERNET OF THINGS (WF-IOT)
M3  - Proceedings Paper
CP  - 4th IEEE World Forum on Internet of Things (WF-IoT)
