TI  - A Routing Decision Algorithm Based on the Trunk Link for Smart City
T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 28TH CHINESE CONTROL AND DECISION CONFERENCE (2016 CCDC)
M3  - Proceedings Paper
CP  - 28th Chinese Control and Decision Conference
