T2  - PROCEEDINGS OF THE 7TH BRAZILIAN TECHNOLOGY SYMPOSIUM (BTSYM'21): EMERGING TRENDS IN SYSTEMS ENGINEERING MATHEMATICS AND PHYSICAL SCIENCES, VOL 2
