AB  - Urbanization has entered the stage of construction of smart cities. At present, the fully automated driving system has also broken through the limitations of traditional traffic driving technology. Under the requirements of integrated automation core subsystems such as vehicles, signals, communications, etc., various changes have been made, the management of vehicle segments and the organization of driving organizations have been implemented. This article takes the current urban rail integrated driving to the development of automatic unmanned technology as the content of the discussion, and seeks the perfect strategy of fully automatic systemized functions of rail transit engineering. It is expected to have reference value for the advancement of China's rail transit.
