TI  - FPGA-Based Implementation of Reduced-Complexity Filtering Algorithm for Real-Time Location Tracking
T2  - IEEE 17TH INT CONF ON DEPENDABLE, AUTONOM AND SECURE COMP / IEEE 17TH INT CONF ON PERVAS INTELLIGENCE AND COMP / IEEE 5TH INT CONF ON CLOUD AND BIG DATA COMP / IEEE 4TH CYBER SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY CONGRESS (DASC/PICOM/CBDCOM/CYBERSCITECH)
