AB  - With the prosperity of software industry and the porpularity of vulnerability trasanction, black vulnerabilities trasaction correspondingly rises to the surface and gets to more rampant, which not only damages the industry and society credit system, also threatens political stability and economic development. Based on subdivision of stakeholder roles in proccess of vulneribility transaction, this paper deepiy studies the reasons for the formation of black maket of vulnerability trasaction and the risks the market brings, forms the legislative recommendations on regulation of market failure, and provides references for the establishment of an orderly vulnerabilities transaction market.Big data, cloud computing, wearable devices, smart city and other new technologies have changed the mode of production and living and thinking, creating a more closely linked human society, which inevitably makes the software vulnerabilities attacks cause more widespread and far-reaching effects. In recent years, with the factors, such as monitor through vulnerabilities by gorvement and with the expansion of vulnerability marketization size of enterprises, join in, development of black industrial chain of vulnerabilities has been promoted. Black transaction's number and size increased because of market failure and lack of regulation measures, resulting national security, enterprise profits and personal pravicy suffer great security risk, thus establishing proper legislation system has already been a necessary means to bulid a reasonable and orderly market of vulnerabilities transaction.
