TI  - Method for checking connection height line height            value applied to smart city, involves checking format            of connected high-pass space data field through            IGeometryDef interface provided by ArcGIS, IFeature            interface, IDataset interface and IFieldEdit            interface
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves checking a high-pass space                data layer by checking a checking item of a                configuration file to check city space data. A                target field which is not matched with a source                field is found, and the found field is recorded. A                layer is identified, and stored in a final error                file. A format of the connected high pass space                data field is checked through an IGeometryDef                interface provided by an ArcGIS(RTM: Geographic                information system (GIS) application), an IFeature                interface, an IDataset interface and an IFieldEdit                interface. A space data is read, and checked and                judged according to the format of the configuration                file.
                    USE - Method for checking connection height line                height value applied to smart city. Can also be                used in military and energy industries.
                    ADVANTAGE - The connected height line height value                checking method is applied to smart city, facing to                the city space data for data processing and GIS                development application, capable of automatic                quality checking for different types of                high-distance line space data, improving the                quality inspection of the data and efficiency of                data warehousing, breaks the bottleneck of the                existing manual operation, and realizes the batch                processing of city space verification and                assignment.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for the                following:a connected height line height value checking                device applied to smart city; anda readable storage medium storing program for                checking connection height line height value.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow diagram illustrating                a method for checking the height of the connected                smart city-pass line. (Drawing includes non-English                language text)
