TI  - Method for training a uniform detection model in            image processing field such as smart city, involves            inputting training samples into the uniform detection            model, where the uniform detection model includes a            feature extraction module
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves inputting training samples                into the uniform detection model, where the uniform                detection model includes a feature extraction                module used to output detection features of                multiple targets. The label of the training sample                and the detection features of multiple targets                construct an optimal transfer problem, where the                label of the training sample is used as the                supplier of the optimal transfer problem, and the                detection grid of the training sample is used as                the optimal transfer problem. The optimal                transmission problem determines the optimal                transmission scheme based on the cost matrix of the                supplier's tag transmission to the detection grid.                The function adjusts the model parameters of the                uniform detection model.
                    USE - Method for training a uniform detection model                in image processing field such as smart city. Can                also be used in industrial application, commercial                application, and military application.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method improves the sensing of the                positive and negative sample boundary, to improve                the stability and accuracy of the uniform detection                algorithm.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for: (1) an                application detection method; (2) a storage                medium.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow diagram of the                method for training a uniform detection model in                image processing field such as smart city. (Drawing                includes non-English language text).
