TI  - Automatic traffic video-based surveillance system            for traffic management in smart cities, has nature            inspired optimizer that is arranged to change traffic            management system into more automatic tracking            system
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system performs automatic number plate                identification with the help of deep learning                model. A mobile-Net architecture is considered for                deep learning model training process. The learning                parameters such as weight and bias values are tuned                by the nature inspired optimizers instead of                traditional optimizers like Adam. The structure                parameters like epochs, iteration and number of                fully connected layers are automatically tuned by                the nature inspired optimizer. The nature inspired                optimizer is arranged to change the traffic                management system into more automatic tracking                system.
                    USE - Deep learning model-based video-based                surveillance security system for traffic management                in smart cities. Uses include but are not limited                to house, finance sector, military security and                traffic management.
                    ADVANTAGE - The execution time of the deep learning model                is reduced with the algorithm of transfer learning                architecture.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic view of the                deep learning model-based video surveillance                security system.
