TI  - Method for charging wireless rechargeable sensor            networks e.g. smart factories and smart cities, used in            military and environmental sensing purposes, involves            collecting location information and status information            from sensor nodes
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves collecting location                information and status information from sensor                nodes constituting a wireless sensor network. Each                sensor node is clustered into a cluster by                analyzing a topology of the wireless sensor network                by using the location information. Different                charging strategies are determined according to a                type of the cluster based on the collected state                information. A charging path is determined based on                collected location information. Sensor nodes                included in the cluster are controlled to charge                according to the determined charging strategy,                where the charging strategy is a charging point, a                charging beam direction, charging power, and a                charging time.
                    USE - Method for charging wireless rechargeable                sensor networks e.g. smart factories and smart                cities, used in military and environmental sensing                purposes.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables adaptively determining                charging process based on density of the sensor                nodes, so that charging efficiency of the wireless                sensor network can be increased.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are also included                for:a computer-readable recording medium for                storing a set of instructions for charging wireless                rechargeable sensor networks used in military and                environmental sensing purposes ;anda wireless charging device for wireless sensor                network.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic view of a                wireless charging device.
