TI  - Method for performing multi-antenna hidden            communication based on frequency spectrum mask used in            smart city, medical care and military communication            fields, involves taking optimal solution as            transmission parameter of hidden transmitter to realize            hidden transmission
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves constructing a hidden                communication system composed of a main system                transmitter, a main system receiver, a hidden                transmitter equipped with M antennas, a                single-antenna hidden receiver and a single-antenna                wiretapping machine. A wiretapping machine                detection strategy and an optimal detection                threshold value are determined. The optimal problem                expression is constructed for making the hidden                communication system to realize the maximum speed.                A joint optimization solution is performed to the                expression to obtain the optimal hidden                transmission power and irregular factor according                to the segmented monotonicity and constraint                condition of the target function. An optimal                solution is taken as a transmission parameter of                the hidden transmitter to realize the hidden                transmission.
                    USE - Method for performing multi-antenna hidden                communication based on frequency spectrum mask used                in smart city, medical care and military                communication fields.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method realizes the hidden communication                under the condition of satisfying the service                quality of the main system and the hidden                requirement of the hidden system, and effectively                ensures the reliability and hidden performance of                the hidden system.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow chart illustrating                the method for performing multi-antenna hidden                communication based on frequency spectrum mask                (Drawing includes non-English language                text).
