TI  - Wireless ad hoc network time delay parameter            calibration device for use in military communication,            includes a calibration industrial computer module, an            excitation source module, and a timing module
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The wireless ad hoc network time delay                parameter calibration device includes a calibration                industrial computer module, an excitation source                module, a timing module, an atomic clock module,                and a digital oscilloscope module. The calibration                industrial computer module is connected to the                excitation source module in communication. The                input end of the excitation source module is                respectively connected to the timing module and the                atomic clock module. The data transmission end of                the excitation source module is used to                respectively connect the source node and the                destination node in the wireless ad hoc network to                be calibrated through a communication cable. The                two measurement terminals of the digital                oscilloscope module are used to connect between the                excitation source module and the source node. The                two ends of the communication cable and the two                ends of the communication cable between the                excitation source module and the destination node                are used to measure the signal transmission                delay.
                    USE - Wireless ad hoc network time delay parameter                calibration device for use in military                communication, emergency communication and                emergency rescue, anti-terrorism, public security                fire, mine work, smart city, and environment                monitoring field.
                    ADVANTAGE - The wireless device can precisely measure and                calibrate the time delay of the wireless ad hoc                network. The device is featured with simple                structure, and low cost. The time amount in the                device can be traced to the national highest                reference and international standard, which can                ensure accurate and reliable time value. The                calibration device not only can perform real-time                monitoring and quantitative analysis to time delay                parameter and time delay jitter condition of                wireless ad-hoc network, but also has wireless                self-networking time delay parameters.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for the                method for calibrating the time delay parameter of                the wireless ad hoc network by using the wireless                ad hoc network time delay parameter calibration                device.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a structure schematic                diagram of the wireless ad hoc network time delay                parameter calibration device for use in military                communication, emergency communication and                emergency rescue, anti-terrorism, public security                fire, mine work, smart city, and environment                monitoring field. (Drawing includes non-English                language text).10Wireless self-networking time delay                parameter calibration device11Calibration industrial control computer                module12Excitation source module13Time service module14Atomic clock module15Digital oscilloscope module20Network time delay parameter testing                system21Corrected wireless self-organized                network22Source node23Destination node24Test system upper computer
