TI  - Intelligent urban artificial intelligence large            data multi-target of information-target, has            establishing state equation of fusion cooperative            tracking positioning system considering unknown            influence, and calculating real-time position and speed            of positioning target to be located
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves establishing a state                equation of a fusion cooperative tracking                positioning system considering an unknown                influence. A measurement equation of the fusion                cooperative tracking positioning system is                established. A factor graph model is established                for considering the unknown influence in the state                equation. A position of a positioning target is                calculated according to a sub-graph model. A                real-time position and a speed of the positioning                target to be located are calculated.
                    USE - Intelligent urban artificial intelligence (AI)                large data multi-target of information-target for                use in city health, resource allocation and                military field of target management. Can also be                used in smart city.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method improves the location precision of                the target to be located, and provides a                positioning precision of intelligent urban AI large                data multi-target of the information-target                combined tracking positioning method.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow chart of the method                of an intelligent urban AI large data multi-target                of the information-target of the multi-target                (Drawing includes non-English language                text).
