TI  - Virtual three-dimensional urban geographic scene            sand table model construction system for use in smart            city application for three-dimensional virtual scene            building technology field, has visual comprehensive            management platform for integrating and controlling            each type of data
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system has a visual comprehensive                management platform for integrating and controlling                each type of data. A three-dimensional geographic                information management platform for realizing a                visual expression of a full geographic element and                overlapping a geographic base map. A                three-dimensional panoramic simulation management                system for realizing an integrated management and                information display based on a three-dimensional                simulation scene model. A side anti-check master                station space-time GIS large data management and a                service platform for realizing the management of                data. The side anti-check master station space-time                GIS large data management and the service platform                for geographic a space-time large data centre                construction.
                    USE - Virtual three-dimensional urban geographic                scene sand table model construction system for                smart city application, government administration                management application, ecological environment                simulation, disaster monitoring, intelligent                traffic, heat supply, resource management, military                simulation and different fields for                three-dimensional virtual scene building technology                field.
                    ADVANTAGE - The system greatly improves controllability                and customization of the system. The system                provides mature and excellent integrated management                solution for a client, and can be flexibly                customized according to requirement of different                industry client, thus making a personalized service                mode. The three-dimensional panoramic simulation                management system is used for realizing the                integrated management and information display based                on the three- dimensional simulation scene model,                and the side anti-check master station space-time                GIS large data management and service platform for                realizing management of data, thus providing space                data base frame for each level management                department, and hence providing geographic space                data processing and configuration and integration                of visualization GIS engine based on multi-source                fusion data.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is also included for a                construction method of virtual three-dimensional                urban geographic scene sand table model.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a system block diagram of                the virtual three-dimensional urban geographic                scene sand table model construction system (Drawing                includes non-English language text).
