TI  - Method for facilitating trust evaluation of node            in wireless sensor network, involves computing direct            observation of node, and comparing datum of reference            and direct observations of node in order to estimate            trustworthiness
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves computing a datum of                reference of a node, where the node computes the                datum of the reference using self-trust evaluation                before to deployment. A direct observation of the                node is computed, where the node computes direct                observations using self-trust evaluation in the                deployment. The datum of reference and the direct                observations of the node are compared in order to                estimate trustworthiness, where the datum of                reference and the direct observation is calculated                using the self-trust evaluation and the datum of                reference/immutable reference is computed using the                self-trust evaluation and embedded into the node                before to the deployment.
                    USE - Method for facilitating trust evaluation of a                node in a wireless sensor network for use in                different applications. Uses include but are not                limited to military applications i.e. battlefield                surveillance, network testing, environmental                monitoring and prediction, industrial control,                space exploration, medical care, smart home, smart                transport and smart cities.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables utilizing the node that                computes the direct observations using the                self-trust evaluation in the deployment and                comparing the datum of reference and the direct                observations of the node which is evaluated from                the node so as to estimate trustworthiness in                reliable manner.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flowchart illustrating a                method for facilitating trust evaluation of a node                in a wireless sensor network.
