TI  - Method for detecting rotating target e.g. ship and            bridge in remote sensing image processing field,            involves integrating inverse angle, central point,            width and height by maximum suppression processing, and            drawing final prediction frame in image
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves obtaining a remote sensing                image data unit. A high resolution remote sensing                image is segmented. Position label frame                information of each target in each divided image is                obtained. A position label frame of each target is                represented by specific form. A rotating target                detection network is constructed. The segmented                remote sensing image is inputted. A target frame is                predicted. A prediction frame in the same form of                the label frame is obtained. A network loss                function is optimized from two aspects of                cross-to-ratio loss and angle regression loss. A                segmented remote sensing image is reasoned to                obtain a parameter. An angle is reversely                calculated. An inverse angle, a central point,                width and height are integrated by maximum                suppression processing. A final prediction frame in                the image is drawn.
                    USE - Method for detecting a rotating target e.g.                ship and bridge in a remote sensing image                processing field. Uses include but are not limited                to military combat field, intelligent traffic field                and smart city field.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method optimizes regression loss function                of a network, effectively improves detection                precision and training efficiency and final                performance of network. The method describes a                rotating frame, and improves loss function and                network training, so as to improve training and                performance of the rotating target detection                network.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow diagram illustrating                a method for detecting a rotating target e.g. ship                and bridge in a remote sensing image processing                field (Drawing includes non-English language                text).
