TI  - Method for integrating radar communication based            on digital programmable super-surface involves            performing integration of radar communication,            realizing two functions of radar detection and wireless            communication simultaneously
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves setting a target in a                radar communication integrated system. A two-phase                coding signal is applied based on a digital                programmable super-surface to perform                one-dimensional distance imaging to the target.                180&#176; phase difference modulation is                performed to a source signal through the                digital-programmable super surface to obtain a                two-channel coding signal through an emitting end.                The signal is transmitted to a receiving end after                being reflected by a target. A received signal is                processed by a matching filtering algorithm at the                receiving end. A radar imaging is performed by                another channel to realize radar communication                integration.
                    USE - Method for integrating radar communication                based on digital programmable super-surface for use                in military and civil needs. Uses include but are                not limited to 6Gwireless communication, smart                city, intelligent cooperation, radar detection and                wireless communication.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method establishes a mechanism for                realizing efficient radar communication integration                based on digital coding super-surface, directly                realizing time and space frequency modulation on                the super- surface interface, so as to compare with                the traditional phased array or multiple input                multiple output (MIMO) antenna, greatly simplifying                the architecture, reducing the system cost. The                encryption and decryption of the wireless security                system, a one-dimensional distance imaging and                radar detection and wireless communication                realizing the function through simulation and                instance to obtain good verification. The radar                communication integrated technology is displayed to                be universal, there is no great potential of the                intelligent terminal which is not in the                place.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic diagram of the                super-surface digital programmable radar                communication.
