TI  - Secure communication method with quantum            encryption, involves performing continuous monitoring            of data in communication network established between            devices by processor running artificial intelligence            algorithms
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves communicating devices with                each other to obtain quantum keys to establish a                secure connection. Quantum key distribution between                devices is initiated, and a quantum communication                channel is established. Wireless communication is                established by a communication unit, and signal is                repeated after the establishment of the quantum                communication channel. Simultaneous quantum key                distribution is performed among all devices that                communicate, and secure mobile communication is                provided through mobile chips. Continuous                monitoring of data in communication network                established between devices is performed by a                processor running artificial intelligence                algorithms, and detection of security breaches is                performed.
                    USE - Secure communication method with quantum                encryption used in critical area such as military                communication, banking, financial institution,                healthcare system or interstate                communication.
                    ADVANTAGE - The flow of data between customers and the                bank is provided with completely unbreakable                encryption. The secure communication system can                ensure that states are protected against espionage                and cyberattacks using quantum encryption in                intelligence services and military communication.                Private meetings between country leaders are                provided through quantum-secure communication                lines. The secure communication system can enable                hospitals and health institutions to completely                prevent unauthorized access by storing patient                records and genetic information with quantum                encryption. The level of security is increased                especially for remote health services and medical                imaging systems. The secure communication system                can enable telecommunication companies to prevent                cyber attacks by implementing quantum security                protocols in and fiber optic networks. User                internet traffic is made 100 % secure, phishing and                man-in-the-middle attacks become impossible. The                secure communication system can enable large                technology companies to secure information stored                in the data centers with quantum encryption. An                electric car communication with traffic lights or                the data coming from smart city security cameras is                prevented from being hacked.
