TI  - Node for communication network of vehicle, has            module operated to receive message from node of vehicle            communication network, and notify identified network            controller of assignment of identified network            controller to mobile access point
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The node has a module operated to receive a                message from a node of a vehicle communication                network (100), identify a network controller (NC)                of the vehicle communication network based on                contents of the message to assign to a mobile                access point (MAP) of the vehicle communication                network, where the identified NC is one of a set of                NCs that are available to serve a geographical area                associated with the MAP, and notify the identified                NC of the assignment of the identified NC to the                MAP. The module is implemented in a cloud mobility                backend (CMB) node of the vehicle communication                network.
                    USE - Node e.g. mobile and static nodes for a                communication network of a vehicle in a                communication environment i.e. controlled space.                Uses include but are not limited to port, harbor,                airport, factory, plantation, and mine, and                privately operated vehicle such as taxi cabs, and                private waste management vehicles, public service                vehicle such as road service vehicles, emergency                vehicles, and port authority vehicles, autonomous                vehicle, manually locally controlled vehicle, and                remotely controlled vehicle, and network such as                enterprise and/or local wireless fidelity                (Wi-Fi)networks, mobile hotspot access network,                fixed hotspot access network, in-vehicle networks,                general controlled-space networks, residential                networks, disaster recovery and emergency networks,                military and aircraft networks, smart city                networks, agricultural networks, underwater and                underground networks, and traffic management                networks.
                    ADVANTAGE - The node provides a platform to be flexibly                optimized for different purposes to reduce latency,                power consumption, load balance, increase                throughput, and reliability, and make more robust                with regard to failures or other disturbances based                on the content, service or data that the platform                provides or handles within a particular                environment.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a block diagram of a                communication network.100Vehicle communication network
