TI  - Unmanned aerial vehicle flight system of            millimetre precision laser virtual ropeway, has data            processing modules for adjusting flight angle of power            modules according to flight adjusting signal, and power            module drives robot laser to slide along virtual            robot
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system has a power module and a laser                sensing module connected with a data processing                module. A virtual ropeway device is provided with a                control module, a ropeway laser emitting module,                and a communication module. The robot laser                emission module and the communication module are                connected with the control module to emit a virtual                robot laser. The communication module sends a                flight adjustment signal to the power module                according to the flight adjustment signals. The                data processing modules adjust a flight angle of                the power modules according to a flight adjusting                signal. The power module drives the robot laser to                slide along the virtual robot.
                    USE - Unmanned aerial vehicle flying system of                millimeter precision laser virtual ropeway. Uses                include but are not limited to intelligent military                police, emergency rescue, smart city, ecological,                electric power, communication, surveying and                mapping, no traffic light traffic, unmanned                agricultural fishery, intelligent outdoor industry,                intelligent service such as unmanned aerial vehicle                logistics and building.
                    ADVANTAGE - The system improves the flight path precision                of the aircraft, and reduces the probability of                aircraft runaway, reduces the aircraft yaw, and                adjusts the flight angle of the power module by the                data processing module according to the flight                adjusting signal.
