TI  - Wireless sensor network coverage optimization            method based on improved marine predator algorithm,            involves obtaining optimized maximum network coverage            and corresponding position deployment solution of            optimum
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves aiming at a target network                monitoring area in a fixed range. The number of                sensor nodes, the deployment positions of the                sensor nodes and the uniform sensing radius and                sensing radius of the sensor nodes in the target                network monitoring area is taken as inputs, and the                network coverage rate of the target network                monitoring area is taken as output, and a sensor                node joint sensing model is constructed based on                Boolean sensing. The parameters to be optimized of                the sensor node joint perception model obtained is                optimized by using the current two-dimensional                deployment position of the sensor node and the                network coverage rate of a target network                monitoring area as inputs and a marine predator                algorithm in combination with Tent chaos is                utilized, to obtain the optimized maximum network                coverage rate and the optimal node position                deployment scheme corresponding to the maximum                network coverage rate.
                    USE - Wireless sensor network coverage optimization                method based on improved marine predator algorithm                in military defense, industrial and agricultural                control, smart city and biomedicine fields.
                    ADVANTAGE - The optimized maximum network coverage rate                and corresponding to the distribution scheme of the                position of the optimum improving the optimization                effect of the marine predator algorithm is                obtained. The network node distribution is more                uniform, covering the blind area and the node                covering redundancy phenomenon is less.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flowchart illustrating                the wireless sensor network coverage optimization                method based on improved marine predator algorithm.                (Drawing includes non-English language text)
