TI  - Trusted system for low power consumption scene,            has block chain that provides hash value of block chain            current block to Internet of things (IOT) platform, and            elliptic curve encrypts public key and private            key
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system has an IoT platform that comprises                a device registration module, a device                authentication module, a data analysis module, a                data display module and a service management module                for displaying the object position, sensor state                and service data. The IoT platform is used for                sending PUF excitation to the IOT terminal and                storing the PUF response. A block chain system is                provided with a data layer, a network layer and a                consensus layer. The block chain provides a hash                value of a block chain current block to the IOT                platform. An elliptic curve encrypts a public key                and a private key. A data display module displays                object position, sensor state and service                data.
                    USE - Trusted link system based on block chain and                PUF for internet of things (IoT) information                security in maritime work, military, aerospace,                smart city and other scene.
                    ADVANTAGE - The system uses block chain as input of PUF                excitation, and performs encryption and decryption                data transmission, which can solve the problem                ofPUF response leakage. The PUF response is stored                without multiple times of excitation and response,                reducing the operation time and operation                capability requirement, suitable for the internet                of things terminal with low power                consumption.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for a trusted                object connection method based on block chain and                PUF.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a system architecture                diagram of a trusted system based on block chain                and PUF. (Drawing includes non-English language                text).
