TI  - Device for providing psychological behavioral            intervention service based on gamification, has reward            unit that provides reward based on behavioral data of            subject, and digitizes behavioral data and provides            points that can purchase avatar customizing items
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The device (40) has a data collection unit                (110) that collects psychological examination data                on a subject. A psychological level definition unit                (120) determines the psychological level of the                subject based on the above psychological test data.                An avatar generation unit (130) generates an avatar                of the subject based on the psychological level. A                scenario providing unit (140) provides scenario                corresponding to the psychological level of the                subject. A visualization unit visualizes the                behavioral data of the subject who performed the                interactive game or scenario. The visualization                unit digitizes the behavioral data and visually                outputs experience points that can grow the avatar.                A reward unit provides a reward based on the                behavioral data of the subject who performed the                interactive game or scenario. The reward unit                digitizes the behavioral data and provides points                that can purchase avatar customizing items.
                    USE - Device for providing psychological behavioral                intervention service based on gamification that                uses mindset and mechanism of games to solve                problems and induce user participation applied in                smart cities, military training and medical                fields.
                    ADVANTAGE - The device provides psychological and                behavioral intervention services based on                gamification to induce active participation of the                subjects and experience different psychological                problems and situations, so that coping ability in                real life is improved and sustainable psychological                and emotional improvement services can be                provided.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for the                following:a method for providing psychological                behavioral intervention service performed by                psychological behavioral intervention service                providing device; anda computer readable recording medium storing                program for providing psychological behavioral                intervention service.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a block diagram of a                gamification-based psychological behavioral                intervention service providing device. (Drawing                includes non-English language text)40Device for providing psychological                behavioral intervention service110Data collection unit120Psychological level definition unit130Avatar generation unit140Scenario providing unit
