TI  - System for facilitating remote update and            distribution of configuration information over            communication network, has processor downloading            available updated information of node using properties            of updated information in received response
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system (800) has a processor for                downloading available updated information of a node                using a set of properties of the updated                information contained in a received response if                determining that the updated information of the                node is available, where the properties comprise an                update location and an indication of a type of a                route to be used to download the updated                information. The processor decrypts the updated                information of the node, applies the decrypted                updated information at the node, and transmits a                notification to a computer system from the node of                successful download and an application of the                decrypted updated information at the node.
                    USE - System for facilitating remote update and                distribution of configuration information over a                communication network of moving things. Uses                include but are not limited to in-vehicle network,                general controlled-space network, residential                network, military and aircraft network, smart city                network, underwater and underground network,                agricultural network, environmental control or                monitoring network, waste management network and                road maintenance network.
                    ADVANTAGE - The system allows a port operator to improve                coordination of ship loading processes and to                increase throughput of a harbor. The system allows                a platform to be flexibly optimized to reduce                latency, increase throughput and reliability and                reduce power consumption based on content, service                or data that the platform provides or handles                within a particular environment.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are also included for the                following:a method for operating a node of a                communication networka non-transitory computer-readable medium                comprising a set of instructions for operating a                node of a communication network.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic block diagram                of a system for facilitating remote update and                distribution of configuration information over a                communication network of moving things.800System for facilitating remote update and                distribution of configuration information over                communication network of moving things801Configuration management entity802Cloud803Configuration clients820Configuration update client
