TI  - Navigation type multifunctional high-altitude wind            power generation system for high-altitude wind power            generation integrated into power grid field, has            stratosphere aerostat system, hanging cable and wind            energy capturing and wireless energy transmission            system connected in turn from top to bottom
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The system has a stratosphere aerostat system                (1), a hanging cable (2) and a wind energy                capturing and wireless energy transmission system                (3). The stratosphere aerostat system, the hanging                cable and the wind energy capturing and wireless                energy transmission system are connected in turn                from top to bottom. The stratosphere aerostat                system comprises an aerostat, a bearing flange                plate, a double-redundancy active control valve, a                top device cabin, a turntable bearing, multiple                flexible bearing belts and multiple upper                connecting cables. The floating device is filled                with light gas. The bearing flange is fixed in the                center of the top of the floating device.
                    USE - Navigation type multifunctional high-altitude                wind power generation system applied to the fields                of high-altitude wind power generation integrated                into the power grid, smart city wireless power                supply base stations, aircraft wireless function                endurance, emergency assistance, aerial high-energy                arsenal, early warning detection, reconnaissance                and surveillance, communication relay, electronic                countermeasures and high-resolution earth                observation (all claimed).
                    ADVANTAGE - The system uses the stratosphere aerostat                system to take the wind energy capturing and                wireless energy transmission system to the high                stable capturing wind energy in the torrent area                and convert the wind energy into the electric                energy, at the same time, the system realizes the                ground energy transmission and multi-task load                military and civilian application scene, and forms                the multi-purpose high altitude wind power                generation system capable of staying in the                long-term area or mechanically transferring.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a perspective view of the                overall structure of an aircraft type multi-purpose                high-altitude wind power generation system.1Stratosphere aerostat system2Hanging cable3Wind energy capturing and wireless energy                transmission system4Parachute5Remote control cutting device6Wind measuring device
