TI  - Unmanned vehicle, has device box whose top end            surface is fixedly mounted with express box, connecting            rod passing through guide groove and fixedly connected            with inner wall surface of adjusting groove, where top            end surface of outer guide rod is fixedly installed            with camera column
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The vehicle has a chassis (1), a wheel (2) and                a device box (3) fixed on an upper end surface of                the wheel. A top end surface of the device box is                fixedly mounted with an express box (4). A corner                of the express box is provided with an adjusting                groove (7), where the adjusting groove passes                through upper and lower end surfaces of an express                cabin. An outer guide rod is connected with an                inner guide rod capable of rotating in the outer                guide rods. A side wall surface of a slide rail is                movably mounted with a slide block capable of                sliding up and down on the slide rail. A connecting                rod passes through a guide groove and fixedly                connected with the inner wall surface of adjusting                groove, where top end surface of outer guide rod is                fixedly installed with a camera column.
                    USE - Unmanned vehicle. Uses include but are not                limited to combat, combat, patrol, reconnaissance,                logistics, transportation, ferry, distribution,                cleaning civil or military task, intelligent                traffic and smart city construction, army equipment                development and national defense security                construction.
                    ADVANTAGE - The guide groove spiral groove can reversely                drive the slide block to slide upwards in the slide                rail, so that the adjusting groove is spirally                upward around the outer guide rod, finally, it is                convenient for special person to collect express,                improving the service level, embodying humanization                design.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a perspective view of the                three-dimensional structure of an unmanned                vehicle.1Chassis2Wheel3Device box4Express box7Adjusting groove
