TI  - Time reversal client used for wireless Internet of            things applications, has processor that connects with            time reversal server through network, obtain set of            channel state information (CSI), and cause CSI to be            sent to time reversal server
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The client includes a wireless transmitter, a                wireless receiver, a processor, and a memory                communicatively coupled to the process. The                processor executes a set of instructions stored in                the memory. The processor is configured to                communicatively couple with a time reversal server                through a network, obtain a set of CSI, and cause                the set of CSI to be sent to the time reversal                server through the network. The set of CSI is                captured when a probing signal is sent from the                transmitter to the receiver through a wireless                multipath channel associated with a space.
                    USE - Time reversal client used for wireless                Internet of things applications. Can be used in                processing CSI based on time reversal techniques                used in e.g. healthcare related applications,                security related applications, gaming services and                virtual reality (VR) related applications, military                related applications, smart home related                applications, smart city related applications,                video-conferencing and communication, navigation,                industry manufacturing, and agriculture                automation.
                    ADVANTAGE - Provides a time reversal client that ensures                reduced transmission bandwidth, streaming, low                latency, low delay, low computational complexity,                high security, low hardware requirements, low                power, ease of management, big data advantage,                network advantage, and transmission advantage.                Ensures high communication capacity, good battery                life, collision-free multiple access, secure                communication, low costs, indoor positioning, life                detection, scalability, and improved privacy and                security.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for the                following:a time reversal client operation method;                anda time reversal server.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a schematic diagram of a                time-reversal system for the Internet of                Things.100Time-reversal wireless communication                system104Laptop computers106Smart phones108Tablet computers110Air conditioners
