TI  - Method for operating mobile node of network for            supporting communication environments in vehicle,            involves communicating sensor data samples to            cloud-based system using data communication interface            configured according to information
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves initializing configuration                of node as first type of node or second type of                node. Information identifying type of power source                providing power is received from a power system to                the node and an amount of power consumed by the                node. Sampling of data is enabled from a sensor at                sampling rate according to configuration                information. Power consumption of a processor is                adjusted according to the amount of power consumed                by the node. Sensor data samples are communicated                to a cloud-based system using data communication                interface configured according to the configuration                information.
                    USE - Method for operating mobile node of a network                for supporting communication environments in a                vehicle. Uses include but are not limited to                operate mobile node of a city-wide vehicular                network, shipping port-sized vehicular network,                campus-wide vehicular network, residential network,                disaster recovery and emergency network, military                network, aircraft network, smart city network,                event network and underwater and underground                network for supporting a smartphone, tablet,                smartwatch, laptop computer, webcam, personal                gaming device, personal navigation device, personal                media device, personal camera and a                health-monitoring device in an automobile, bus,                lorry, boat, forklift, human-operated vehicle,                autonomous vehicle, remote controlled vehicle and a                train.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables flexibly optimizing a                platform for different purposes to reduce latency,                increase throughput, reduce power consumption, load                balance, increase reliability, make robust with                regard to failures or disturbances of the platform.                The method enables providing a communication                network to allow a port operator to improve                coordination of ship loading processes and increase                throughput of a harbor. The method enables ensuring                harbor authorities to quickly detect malfunctioning                trucks and abnormal truck's circulation, thus                avoiding accidents in order to increase harbor                efficiency, security and safety.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are also included for the                following:a non-transitory computer-readable medium                comprising a set of instructions for operating                mobile node of a network for supporting                communication environments in a vehiclea system for operating mobile node of a                network for supporting communication environments                in a vehicle.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a block diagram of a                communication network.100Communication network
