TI  - Method for implementing fine three-dimensional            modelling of building object frame model using computer            graphics image processing technology for constructing            e.g. digital city, involves obtaining high resolution            satellite image of building, building outline            electronic map and Baidu panoramic image
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves obtaining a                high-resolution satellite image of a building, a                building outline electronic map and a Baidu                panoramic image. The high-resistance remote sensing                image, the building outline graphic map and the                building layout graphic map are imported by using                ArcGIS (Geographic information system                application)software. The registration and                geometric correction pre-processing is performed to                extract the height of the building, attribute                information of the floor layer and roof type. The                extracted information is saved to a geographic                information system (GIS) database for integration.                The building wall window polygon is taken as the                model input. The roof polygon of the roof is used                as the input of the model. The model is constructed                to realize the automatic building three-dimensional                model.
                    USE - Method for implementing fine three-dimensional                modelling of a building object frame model using                computer graphics image processing technology for                constructing digital city, virtual city and smart                city. Uses include but are not limited to door                scientific technology, urban landscape planning,                building design, military simulation, travel                development, navigation development and ancient                building protection.
                    ADVANTAGE - The three-dimensional modeling refinement                degree is high, and has low cost, simple operation,                high automation characteristics, and high building                three- dimensional modeling refinement degrees. The                method is featured with low cost and simple                operation. The data collecting module comprises a                high resolution satellite image, building outline                electronic map, Baidu panoramic image, satellite                image of the building, the outline e map and the                panorama image are modeling data source, not only                can extract the macro boundary of building in the                city range, but also can capture the geometric                detail and texture detail characteristic of                building, and improves the refinement of building                three dimensional modeling degree. The building                object frame model fine 3D modeling method solves                the background technology proposed in the existing                building three dimension modeling method cost,                complex operation and complex, large labor                intensity.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is also included for a                three-dimensional modelling system for the building                body frame model.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow chart illustrating                the method for implementing fine three-dimensional                modelling of a building object frame model.                (Drawing includes non-English language                text).
