TI  - Method for evaluating health operation of unmanned            aerial vehicle based on digital twinning, involves            analyzing based on health evaluation parameter, and            visualizing vehicle operation state in digital twinning            health control platform
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves collecting related data of                an unmanned aerial vehicle, and constructing a                digital twin model of the unmanned aerial vehicle.                The cross fusion and iterative feedback on the                related data of the unmanned aerial vehicle is                carried out. A digital twin health management and                control platform of the unmanned aerial vehicle is                constructed based on the fusion result, and the                supervision of the health state of the unmanned                aerial vehicle is realized. The fault diagnosis and                prediction on the operation process of the unmanned                aerial vehicle is performed based on the digital                twin health management and control platform of the                unmanned aerial vehicle, and the health evaluation                parameters are outputted, and analyzed based on the                health evaluation parameters. The running state of                the unmanned aerial vehicle in the unmanned aerial                vehicle digital twin health management and control                platform is visualized, and the health evaluation                of the unmanned aerial vehicle is decided.
                    USE - Method for evaluating health operation of                unmanned aerial vehicle based on digital twinning                for use in agricultural plant protection, national                land resource planning, emergency rescue, forest                fire prevention, smart city, military politics and                leisure travel fields.
                    ADVANTAGE - The unmanned aerial vehicle health operation                evaluation method reduces the operation risk of the                unmanned aerial vehicles, improves the unmanned                vehicle operation safety, so as to improve the                unmanned vehicles health operation and solve the                unmanned aircraft vehicle health evaluation                problem. The communication problem of unmanned                vehicle is effectively improved. The unmanned                vehicle health condition is displayed quickly and                intuitively through the interaction feedback of the                virtual environment aerial vehicle data in the real                environment, accurately and virtual environment                displaying the real condition of unmanned vehicles,                saving the maintenance cost. The cooperation of                unmanned aircraft safe operation is effectively                realized, combining the 5G technology, effectively                improving the communication problem and reducing                cost.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flowchart illustrating                the method for evaluating health operation of                unmanned aerial vehicle based on digital twinning.                (Drawing includes non-English language text)
