TI  - Method for operating e.g. smartphone for            supporting wireless network for mobile and static            nodes, involves transmitting combined information            derived according to specified condition and specified            environment to originator of request
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves deriving combined                information representative of conditions of an                environment in, which electronic devices are                located by utilizing sensor data samples selected                from sensor data samples received from sensor                devices of the electronic devices according to                conditions and respective type of the sensor data                samples. Combined information derived according to                the specified condition and the specified                environment is transmitted to an originator of                request responsive to receiving a request for                information representative of a specified condition                of the conditions and a specified environment in,                which the electronic devices are located. The                environment is selected as one of a geographic                region or a vehicle. The conditions comprise one of                comfort of occupants of a vehicle, a physical                condition of a road traveled by a vehicle, and a                physical location of an occupant of a                vehicle.
                    USE - Method for operating a network device e.g.                smartphone, laptop or tablet computer for                supporting a wireless network for mobile and static                nodes in a controlled space. Uses include but are                not limited to an in-vehicle network, an autonomous                vehicle network, devices, a maritime or watercraft                and port network, a general controlled-space                network, a residential network, a disaster recovery                and emergency network, a military and aircraft                network, a smart city network, an agricultural                network and a security and surveillance network for                use in a port, a harbor, an airport, a factory, a                plantation, and a mine.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables flexibly optimizing a                network device at design/installation time and/or                in real-time so as to reduce the latency, increase                throughput, reduce power consumption, load balance,                increase reliability, and avoid failures or                disturbances based on the content, service or data                that the platform provides or handles within a                particular environment. The method enables                collecting real-time information on a position,                speed, fuel consumption and carbon-di-oxide                emissions of vehicles in a port and/or harbor                implementation, so that the communication network                allows a port operator to improve the coordination                of ship loading processes and increase the                throughput of a harbor.
