TI  - Infrared and visible light image fusion method            based on multi-granularity word element e.g. military,            involves processing relation extraction parameter in            preset logic to obtain long-range dependent relation            from infrared image and light image
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves collecting and obtaining                (S1) the visible infrared image on the different                scale not less than 2. The long-range dependent                relationship of the infrared image and the visible                light image is calculated (S2). A coding position                information is added in each sequence to obtain a                coded infrared sequence. An embedding operation is                performed on the encoded infrared sequence by using                a full connection layer. A multi-head                self-attention mechanism is utilized to process a                relation extraction parameter in a preset logic. A                long-range dependent relation is obtained from the                infrared image. The infrared image and the visible                light image is fused (S3) by the multi-granularity                word element fusion output image. The                multi-granularity word element fusion output image                is obtained. The preset reconstruction logic is                used to process the multi-granularity word element                corelation and scale characteristic so as to obtain                the multi-granularity word element fusion output                image.
                    USE - Infrared and visible light image fusion method                based on multi-granularity word element used in                information acquisition or analysis, such as                military, public security, and smart                city,etc.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables capturing the correlation                of the corresponding word element by introducing                the learable attention value so as to fuse the                infrared image and visible light image under the                multi-granularity word element dimension, thus                sensing difference of multi-mode information of the                infrared and the visible light word element in the                same position. The method allows extracting                long-range dependent relation of each image on                multi-scale, and embeds multi- granularity word                elements by local multi-dimensional division                sub-image using multigranularity fusion to                reconstruct multi- scale feature, calculating the                fusion image through the dimension reduction                mapping operation, and realizing fusion of the                multidimensional lower infrared and visible lights                image based on pure, and has better fusion                performance relative to other schemes.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - An INDEPENDENT CLAIM is included for the                infrared and visible light image fusion system                based on multi-granularity word element.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows the schematic diagram of an                infrared and visible light image fusion method                based on multi-granularity word element. (Drawing                includes non-English language text)S1Step for collecting and obtaining the                visible infrared image on the different scale not                less than 2S2Step for calculating long-range dependent                relationship of the infrared image and the visible                light imageS3Step for monitoring and training the preset                multi-granularity word element fusion model using                the preset logic design loss functionS4Step for fusing the infrared image and the                visible light image by the multi-granularity word                element fusion output image
