TI  - Method for utilizing communication line            certificate corresponding to e.g. Internet-of-things            (IoT) devices, for communication line, involves            verifying proof by first device to produce verification            of association of second device to secure communication            line, and generating acceptance by first device
AB  - 
                   NOVELTY - The method involves generating a                digitally-signed request by first device, where the                digitally-signed request comprises first proof of                an association of the first device to a secure                communication line (109). The digitally-signed                request is transmitted to second device. The first                proof is verified by the second device to produce a                verification of an association of the first device                to the secure communication line. A                digitally-signed acceptance is generated by the                second device, where the digitally-signed                acceptance comprises second proof of an association                of the second device to the secure communication                line.
                    USE - Method for utilizing a communication line                certificate corresponding to electronic devices                i.e. Internet-of-things (IoT) devices for a                communication line. Uses include but are not                limited to components of an automobile, an oil                pump, a household appliance, an aircraft, a medical                device, an electrical grid, a smart city, a                military weapon system, robots, meters, valves,                pumps, motors, cameras, an electrical grid and                specific components of larger systems such as                steering control of a ship and propulsion system of                a motorized vehicle.
                    ADVANTAGE - The method enables adopting manufactured                products with robust access control so as to                prevent unauthorized parties from gaining access to                the device or data. The method enables recording                records on a blockchain to realize decentralization                of data storage and control process. The method                enables realizing efficient, secure and reliable                solution to retrieve and manage data. The method                ensures capability to enable an entity to invite                users or individuals to the secure communication                line without typically exposing the entity                infrastructure. The method enables realizing                function to allow an entity system administrator to                track, monitor and/or audit transmitted encrypted                digital content and ensures capability to create a                separate database of associates and affiliates                including right to revoke invitation or                relationship. The method ensures capability for the                entity to send an encrypted digital content outside                an entity firewall with a result to ensure secure                performance of a digital content. The method                ensures capability to integrate security ecosystem                and/or application programming interface (API) data                records with active directory or a similar system                with an entity public key infrastructure (PKI) and                enables achieving reduction in Data Spawn i.e.                tendency of unencrypted sensitive digital content                to be repeatedly copied and transferred to a                person, entity and/or location with a result that                the original sensitive digital content is located                in multiple places and/or with multiple individuals                or entities, thus ensuring security through the                capabilities of a security ecosystem and the API by                transferring the digital content to multiple places                and/or with multiple individuals or entities in a                typically-encrypted format and storing the digital                content in an encrypted format, and hence reducing                an uncontrolled and/or un-audited distribution of                unencrypted sensitive digital content. The method                enables adopting digital signatures to provide an                integrated, persistent and capability between an                entity and a user to improve efficiency and                reliability of remote document execution.
                    DETAILED DESCRIPTION - INDEPENDENT CLAIMS are included for:(1) a system for establishing a secure                communication between devices coupled to a                communication network; and(2) a system for utilizing a communication                line certificate over a computer network.
                    DESCRIPTION Of DRAWING(S) - The drawing shows a flow diagram of a process                of a trust stack.101PKI103Root certificate-based                authentication109Secure communication line115Maintenance group121Dashboard
