. End of Addendum v1.1 This addendum is now ready to attach to: ��� your Zenodo white paper��� the licensing section of your collaboration document��� GitHub / OSF / CPR entries��� the Collective IP registry��� any public-safe releases of CollectiveOS concepts Copyright: THE IMMORTAL TEK PUBLIC BENEFIT & COMMERCIAL RESERVATION LICENSE (IT-PBCR License v1.0) (Patent-Free Science �� Defensive Prior Art �� Commercial Rights Reserved) Brewtanius Ink LLC/ THE COLLECTIVE AI/ Immortal Tek Inc
